@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: My Tasks

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Shared workflow / Voice Search
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Cross-role task list (the Employee Dashboard task list) and
the location of the mandatory voice search feature.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Any signed-in user

ROUTE: /Tasks

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Task query per role (requests to review, offers to check,
  scores to enter, votes to cast).
- Voice search: SpeechRecognition with graceful fallback;
  search only the user’s own tasks.

DEPENDENCIES:
PurchaseRequests, TenderRounds, Bids, CommitteeRounds,
TenderReports.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Voice search is a mandatory assignment feature without a
Trello card — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    Layout = WorkspaceNavigation.LayoutFor(User);
    ViewData["Title"] = "My Tasks";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "My Tasks";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Work waiting for you across the workflow, with voice search.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="pg-toolbar" aria-label="Search tasks">
    <input type="search" placeholder="Search my tasks" aria-label="Search my tasks" />
    @* TODO (UNASSIGNED — Voice Search, mandatory): use the browser SpeechRecognition API to fill this search, with permission handling and a text fallback. *@
    <button type="button" class="pg-btn" disabled title="Voice search is not implemented yet">🎤 Voice search</button>
    <span class="pg-hint">Search and voice search are not implemented yet.</span>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-my-tasks">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-my-tasks">My tasks</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Task</th><th scope="col">Related record</th><th scope="col">Stage</th><th scope="col">Waiting since</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="5"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No tasks are loaded yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
